        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It is understood that, in the application of this Agreement, an employee's employment date shall date from the beginning of his employment with the Employer and not from the signing of this agreement. Said employment date shall remain unchanged unless continuity of employment is broken pursuant to the provisions of Section 16 (Seniority).",
